# Host packages for the Lenovo ThinkPad P14s Gen 4 (AMD), layer 05 (one snapshot).
# Firmware for its devices (amdgpu, ath11k Wi-Fi, QCA Bluetooth, ACP audio, Realtek
# dock NICs) and ucode-amd are already in a minimal SLES 16.1 (kernel-firmware-all).
# Goodix 27c6:6594 fingerprint reader (enrol: omarchy-setup-security-fingerprint)
fprintd
fprintd-pam
libfprint-2-2
# USB4/Thunderbolt device authorization (docks)
bolt
# BIOS/firmware updates from LVFS (ThinkPads are supported)
fwupd
# SOF firmware for AMD/Intel audio DSPs (what Omarchy installs on laptops)
sof-firmware
# External monitor brightness (Omarchy's omarchy-brightness-display-ddc); access via
# omageeko-hardware's uaccess rule for display I2C buses
ddcutil
